    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27442" root="طيخ" body-key="T">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طِيخٌ</span></b>  a word imitative of the sound of laughing. (Sb, K.) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَالُوا طِيخِ طِيخِ</span>, the word <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طيخ</span>
being in this case indecl., with kesr for its
termination, means <i>They uttered a reiterated
laughing</i> [<i>like a repeating of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طِيخ</span>]. (Lth, K,
TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also, and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَيْخٌ</span></b> , <i>Ignorance.</i> (TA.)

